---
import FakeQr from "./FakeQr.astro";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import Scene from "./Scene.astro";
---

<section id="como-funciona" class="section steps-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Cómo funciona</span>
      <h2>Tres pasos. <span class="gradient-text">Cero complicaciones.</span></h2>
      <p>Si sabes hacer una foto con el móvil, sabes usar PhotoBridge.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step" data-reveal>
        <div class="art art-pc">
          <div class="mini-window">
            <div class="mini-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="mini-body">
              <FakeQr size={92} />
              <span>Escanea con tu móvil</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <span class="num">1</span>
          <h3>Abre PhotoBridge en el ordenador</h3>
          <p>Descárgalo y haz doble clic. Aparece una ventana con un código QR. No hay que instalar ni configurar nada.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step" data-reveal style="--delay: 100ms">
        <div class="art art-scan">
          <div class="viewfinder">
            <span class="corner tl"></span>
            <span class="corner tr"></span>
            <span class="corner bl"></span>
            <span class="corner br"></span>
            <FakeQr size={78} />
            <span class="scanline"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="pill"><Icon name="sparkles" size={13} /> Abrir PhotoBridge</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <span class="num">2</span>
          <h3>Escanea el QR con la cámara</h3>
          <p>Apunta con la cámara del móvil y toca el aviso que aparece. PhotoBridge se abre en el navegador, sin instalar ninguna app.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step" data-reveal style="--delay: 200ms">
        <div class="art art-folder">
          <div class="stack">
            <div class="photo p1"><Scene variant={0} /></div>
            <div class="photo p2"><Scene variant={5} /></div>
            <div class="photo p3"><Scene variant={1} /></div>
          </div>
          <div class="send-btn"><Icon name="arrowRight" size={14} strokeWidth={2.6} /> Enviar al ordenador</div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <span class="num">3</span>
          <h3>Elige tus fotos y pulsa «Enviar»</h3>
          <p>Selecciona fotos y vídeos. En unos segundos estarán en la carpeta <strong>Imágenes › PhotoBridge</strong>.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="requirement" data-reveal>
      <span class="req-icon"><Icon name="wifi" size={20} /></span>
      <p>
        <strong>Solo una condición:</strong> el móvil y el ordenador tienen que estar conectados a la
        <strong>misma wifi</strong> (el ordenador también puede ir por cable al mismo router).
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps-section {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
  }
  .step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .step:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .art {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: 220px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 120%, rgb(67 83 255 / 0.18), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-soft), var(--surface));
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .step-text {
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .num {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--grad);
    color: #fff;
    font: 700 15px/1 var(--font-display);
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
  }
  .step h3 {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
  .step p {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .step strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Paso 1 */
  .mini-window {
    width: 180px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .mini-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mini-bar i {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--border-strong);
  }
  .mini-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 10px 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .mini-body :global(svg) {
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--border);
  }

  /* Paso 2 */
  .viewfinder {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 132px;
    height: 132px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #2a2f52, #0f1222);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .corner {
    position: absolute;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border: 3px solid #fff;
  }
  .tl {
    top: 14px;
    left: 14px;
    border-right: 0;
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-top-left-radius: 8px;
  }
  .tr {
    top: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    border-left: 0;
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-top-right-radius: 8px;
  }
  .bl {
    bottom: 14px;
    left: 14px;
    border-right: 0;
    border-top: 0;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 8px;
  }
  .br {
    bottom: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    border-left: 0;
    border-top: 0;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 8px;
  }
  .scanline {
    position: absolute;
    left: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #19c3fb;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px 2px rgb(25 195 251 / 0.7);
    animation: scan 2.6s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes scan {
    from {
      top: 26px;
    }
    to {
      top: 104px;
    }
  }
  .pill {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 90%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .pill :global(svg) {
    color: var(--brand-1);
  }

  /* Paso 3 */
  .stack {
    position: relative;
    width: 150px;
    height: 120px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .photo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 4px solid #fff;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .p1 {
    transform: rotate(-10deg) translate(-18px, 6px);
  }
  .p2 {
    transform: rotate(8deg) translate(18px, 2px);
  }
  .p3 {
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }
  .send-btn {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--grad);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    box-shadow: var(--glow);
  }

  .requirement {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid rgb(67 83 255 / 0.22);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  .requirement p {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .requirement strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .req-icon {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgb(67 83 255 / 0.1);
    color: var(--brand-1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .requirement {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
